Third-party notes (not covered by this license)

- Mixamo characters (Y Bot or any other): Adobe Mixamo terms. No
  character FBX is included and none may be redistributed — download
  your own from mixamo.com and build the scene with
  pipeline/setup_rig.py.
- GVHMR (zju3dv): separate license, cloned into tools/ by the user.
  Its pretrained checkpoints carry their own terms.
- SMPL-X body model (MPI): registration-gated license at
  https://smpl-x.is.tue.mpg.de/ — never committed to this repo.
- pytorch3d Windows wheels: community builds by MiroPsota
  (torch_packages_builder), BSD-licensed pytorch3d (Meta).
- Blender MCP add-on: Blender Lab, GPL-3.0-or-later (runs inside
  Blender; this repo only talks to its socket).
- The motion clips under clips/ and the generated plates under plates/
  are original content released under the MIT license above.
